{"displayStem":"처음 약물이 없는 두 일구획 모형에 같은 속도로 P를 지속 정맥 주입하였다. 분포용적은 같고 제거는 일차 과정이다. 가·나 곡선은 독립적으로 계산한 모의자료이며 점선·실선과 점 표지는 조건 구분이다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육 목적으로 구성한 학습자료입니다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence b08-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><table><thead><tr><th>조건</th><th>주입속도 (mg/h)</th><th>분포용적 (L)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>가</td><td>83.18</td><td>40</td></tr><tr><td>나</td><td>83.18</td><td>40</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","<div class=\"dataset-evidence b08-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"measurement-panels\"><figure class=\"measurement-panel\"><figcaption>가·나의 주입 후 농도</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"가·나의 주입 후 농도。투여 후 시간 (h)、농도 (mg/L)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"526\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"20\" y=\"25\">농도 (mg/L)</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"76\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"186\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"186\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"186\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><line x1=\"296\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"296\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">12</text><line x1=\"406\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"406\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">18</text><line x1=\"516\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"516\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"516\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">24</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"185.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"185.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"190.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">6.25</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"142\